<h1 align="center">Hey there ! 👋 Je suis {{ profile.name }}</h1>

<p align="center">
  <em>{{ lang.bio }}</em>
</p>

<p align="center">
  {% if profile.location %}
  <img src="{{ badge('Localisation '~profile.location, 'blue', {logo: 'googlemaps'}) }}" alt="{{ profile.location }}"/>
  {% endif %}
  {% for social in socials %}
  {{ badge_link(social.url, social.label, social.color, {logo: social.icon})|raw }}
  {% endfor %}
  {{ badge_link('https://ktherage.github.io/', 'Blog EN', 'blue', {logo: 'googlechrome'})|raw }}
  {{ badge_link('https://ktherage.github.io/fr/', 'Blog FR', 'blue', {logo: 'googlechrome'})|raw }}
</p>

---

## 🧑‍💻 À propos

- 🔭 Je travaille actuellement sur des projets **{{ profile.company }}**
- 🌱 Je suis en train d'apprendre **{{ lang.learning|join(', ') }}**
- 💬 Demandez-moi sur **{{ lang.ask_me_about|join(', ') }}**
- ⚡ Fun fact: *{{ lang.fun_fact }}*

---

## 🛠️ Stack Technique

<p align="center">
  {% for l in languages %}
  <img src="{{ lang_badge(l.name, l.color, l.percentage) }}" alt="{{ l.name }}"/>
  {% endfor %}
</p>

---

## 📊 GitHub Stats

<p align="center">
  {% if profile.public_repos > 0 %}<img src="{{ badge('Repos-'~profile.public_repos, 'blue', {logo: 'github'}) }}" alt="Repositories"/>{% endif %}
  {% if total_stars > 0 %}<img src="{{ badge('Stars-'~total_stars, 'yellow', {logo: 'github'}) }}" alt="Stars"/>{% endif %}
  {% if total_forks > 0 %}<img src="{{ badge('Forks-'~total_forks, 'green', {logo: 'github'}) }}" alt="Forks"/>{% endif %}
  {% if profile.followers > 0 %}<img src="{{ badge('Followers-'~profile.followers, 'orange', {logo: 'github'}) }}" alt="Followers"/>{% endif %}
</p>

---

## 🏆 Top Projets

| Projet | Description | ⭐ |
|--------|-------------|-----|
{% for repo in top_repos %}
| [{{ repo.name }}]({{ repo.html_url }}) | {{ repo.description|truncate(80) }} | {{ repo.stargazers_count }} |
{% endfor %}

---

## 📝 Derniers Articles

{% for article in blog_articles.fr %}
### [{{ article.title }}]({{ article.url }})
<sub>{{ article.date|format_date(locale='fr') }} · {{ article.tags|join(', ') }}</sub>

{{ article.excerpt|truncate(200) }}

{% endfor %}

---

## 🕐 Activité Récente

| Projet | Dernier Push |
|--------|-------------|
{% for repo in recent_repos %}
| [{{ repo.name }}]({{ repo.html_url }}) | {{ repo.pushed_at|date('j M Y') }} |
{% endfor %}

